Error [jet.CredentialValueDenied]: A `Credential` value is denied at `show`
  --> Tests/UI/Taint/credential_reaching_a_user_function_that_prints_is_e0722.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     show(token)
    |     ^^^^
 Why: `show` writes to a log, terminal, or serialized output, where a credential would leak
 Fix: Log a non-secret field, or pass the value through a matching `#Scrub(Credential)` function
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0722
